# D26 - FMOVE.P FPn,(An)+{Dn} and -(An){Dn}. The fork steps An by the twelve
# bytes of a packed operand (MC68881/MC68882 UM); the oracle's size table
# holds 0 for the dynamic k-factor format and leaves An where it was.
